    },
    {
      "quote": "Have we experienced in San Jose any unauthorized access breaches or improper disclosures of ALPR data since the program was implemented?",
      "paragraph_idx": 19
    },
    {
      "quote": "When people ask whether their data is safe, they are asking about all misuse, inside or outside",
